### FlaggedQuestionController
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@studentId = 4
@questionId = 204
@chapterId = LC5H0102

### Flag a question for a student
POST {{baseUrl}}/flagged-questions/student/{{studentId}}/question/{{questionId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Flag another question
POST {{baseUrl}}/flagged-questions/student/{{studentId}}/question/205
Accept: application/json

###

### Flag one more question
POST {{baseUrl}}/flagged-questions/student/{{studentId}}/question/210
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all flagged questions for a student in a specific chapter
GET {{baseUrl}}/flagged-questions/student/{{studentId}}/chapter/{{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get all flagged questions for a student (across all chapters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/flagged-questions/student/{{studentId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Unflag a question for a student
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/flagged-questions/student/{{studentId}}/question/{{questionId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Try to flag the same question again (should return existing)
POST {{baseUrl}}/flagged-questions/student/{{studentId}}/question/205
Accept: application/json

###

### Unflag another question
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/flagged-questions/student/{{studentId}}/question/205
Accept: application/json

###

### Get flagged questions after unflagging (should have fewer)
GET {{baseUrl}}/flagged-questions/student/{{studentId}}/chapter/{{chapterId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get unpracticed flagged questions for a student in a specific chapter
# This endpoint returns only flagged questions that have NOT been correctly answered
GET {{baseUrl}}/flagged-questions/student/{{studentId}}/chapter/{{chapterId}}/unpracticed
Accept: application/json

###